    skos:scopeNote "Relates to dpv:PreventativeProtectionOfPersons already proposed in IMPACTO but this could be added to relate to data or property without defining the target of the protection."@en .

dpv:PrivateEventOrganisation a rdfs:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
