    dcterms:source "AI Act Annex III, point 6"@en ;
    skos:note "Processing by competent authorities for law enforcement purposes falls under the Law Enforcement Directive rather than the GDPR, so the corresponding assessment obligation is Art.27 LED rather than Art.35 GDPR."@en ;
    skos:prefLabel "Law enforcement uses"@en ;
